            (Wikipedia) &mdash; notation, validity tests, and synchronous
            siteswap rules
        </li>
        <li>
            <a href="https://jugglinglab.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Juggling Lab</a>
            &mdash; standard online siteswap animator; useful cross-check for
            notation and pattern behavior
        </li>
    </ul>
